# The environment of the specs. dotenv reads this file before .env, thus each value here wins.
#
# ⚠️ The specs write and delete real keys, and they use no namespace. With the REDIS_URL of .env,
# each `rspec` run deletes `bluesky:credentials`, `mastodon:credentials`, and `threads:credentials`
# in the Redis of your own machine, and that disconnects the accounts that you connected in the
# admin. Database 1 of the local Redis keeps the specs away from that data. CI sets REDIS_URL in the
# environment, and that value wins over this file.
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/1
